    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Bowe Property are delighted to bring to the open market this charming two-bedroom property, ideally situated at Hewitt’s Bridge, Clancoolmore, Bandon. Offering accommodation extending to approximately 70 sq.m., this property presents an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, those looking to downsize or indeed anyone seeking a home with excellent potential to enlarge additional living accommodation. Accommodation is set over two floors and consists of two bedrooms, with one bedroom en-suite, together with a family bathroom, comfortable living room and a fully fitted kitchen/dining room, with a staircase off the hallway to two generous attic rooms, offering excellent potential for further development, subject to the necessary planning and building regulation requirements. The property has a host of features throughout including oil-fired central heating, a solid fuel stove, ceramic tiling and built-in wardrobes, while the practical layout provides comfortable living accommodation. Externally, the property enjoys a generous private driveway with ample off-street parking, complemented by spacious gardens that provide an attractive outdoor space. Ideally positioned in the Clancoolmore area of Bandon, the property enjoys a pleasant private residential setting while being within easy reach of Bandon town and all of its wonderful amenities. Bandon offers an excellent range of schools, shops, supermarkets, cafés, restaurants, sporting facilities and local services, together with convenient access to Cork City and the wider West Cork region. Hewitt's Bridge lends itself as an ideal starter home, investment property or property to downsize, while the additional attic space provides significant potential for those looking to further enhance the accommodation, subject to the necessary permissions.\r\n\r\nViewing comes highly recommended by the sole selling agent and is strictly by prior appointment."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 4.29m x 2.54m x 1.23m\r\nAccess to living room, kitchen/dining room, bathroom,  bedrooms and airing cupboard. Staircase to two attic store rooms. Ceramic tiled floors. Radiator. \r\n\r\n\r\nLiving Room - 4.32m x 3.68m\r\nWooden boards. Window to large onto front gardens. Integrated solid fuel stove  with granite hearth and stone over mantle. T.V point. Radiator. \r\n\r\n\r\nKitchen - 4.42m x 3.73m\r\nFully fitted with presses and cupboards. Appliances include fridge/freezer, integrated electric oven and grill. Ceramic hob. Plumbed and fitted with washing machine. Plumbed and fitted for dishwasher. Window and door to rear. Radiator.\r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 4.13m x 3.56m\r\nBuilt in robes. Window to front of property. Radiator.\r\n\r\n\r\nBathroom - 2.66m x 2.02m\r\nFully fitted with w.c, wash-hand basin and electric shower. Ceramic tiled walls & floors. Mechanical extractor. Window to rear. Wall mounted electric radiator. \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 2  - 3.68m x 3.0m\r\nFitted robe. Window to rear of property. Radiator. Access to en suite.\r\nEn suite ( 2.37m x 1.26m)\r\nSliding door access. Fully fitted with w.c, wash-hand basin. Over sized electric shower with sliding glazed shower door access. Mechanical extractor. Window to rear. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nAttic\r\nLarge attic divided into two attic store rooms.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nFeatures & Services\r\n- Oil fired central heating\r\n- Mains services"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "-\r\n-Well appointed two bed detached home.\r\n-Accommodation of approx. 70.sq.m\r\n-Within walking distance to Bandon Town and all of its amenities. \r\n-Oil fired central heating.\r\n-Private off street parking.\r\n-BER No.119636165"
      },
      {
